      "message": "@pirama@google.com for whether we want to relax this requirement.\n\nAdding `-target` to the command line can easily cause incompatibilities with other flags, especially around clang updates.  This check was added because a clang update stopped accepting `-march\u003d` arguments when `-target\u003dbpf` was added to the comamnd line, but could easily also fail for your use case if Soong added x86-specific flags to the command line, or clang became stricter about existing nonsensical x86 flags.",
