      "writtenOn": "2025-04-02T12:23:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Colin, to give you some background, ARM is developing an arm64 ART simulator that runs on host. In their use case, they do want the compiler to generate arm64 code for host, which is not currently supported by the build system. That\u0027s why they need a build system change to force arm64 on host. The change is guarded by an env var `ART_USE_SIMULATOR`, so it doesn\u0027t affect normal code paths. To me, either relaxing the restriction for `ART_USE_SIMULATOR` or adding a new property is okay. WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "1c545abe_640fe217",
      "revId": "99fd863014bffe145d795858c4a5c01a5d44e47c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
