      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you configure your build for aosp_arm64-trunk_staging-eng, then build your simulator files as normal device modules, you can then create a `cc_device_for_host` module that makes the output files of the arm64 device modules available to host modules.  As far as I can tell that gives you exactly the same behavior as you are adding here.",
