      "writtenOn": "2025-05-19T21:17:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `force_arm64` method is breaking various abstractions in Soong.  It is creating a module whose toolchain has been overwritten to be arm64, but whose Arch is still x86_64.\n\nYou probably want to create your own dependency tag the way `java_device_for_host` does.  Then you would visit your dependencies, collect relevant data from their providers, and then use SetProvider to re-export that data.",
      "parentUuid": "42d30609_0c316d9c",
      "revId": "99fd863014bffe145d795858c4a5c01a5d44e47c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
